  "prefLabel": "Res 211.01 Role of Department Staff in Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 211.01 Role of Department Staff in Enforcement or Disciplinary Hearings. Unless called as witnesses, department staff shall have no role in any enforcement or disciplinary hearing.\n\nSource. #7568-A, eff 10-1-01, EXPIRED: 7-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res200.html"
